<title>CANADA: Canada's Prairies to see rain west, sun east.</title>
<headline>Canada's Prairies to see rain west, sun east.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canada's Prairies on Monday were forecast to see rain in the west, sun in the east, Environment Canada said.</p>
<p>Alberta should see rain and highs of 10 to 15 Celsius.</p>
<p>Saskatchewan should see a mix of rain and cloud with highs of 6 to 16 Celsius.</p>
<p>Manitoba should see sun with highs of 16 to 19 Celsius.</p>
<p>((Gilbert Le Gras 204 947 3548))</p>
